   "text": "inlab-human has a reader-study protocol (bundle, review,\nreport), a clinician console (haichat-inlab), the endpoint-predict\ntool both use, an agent drawer, and a de-identification boundary\nit does not enforce itself.",
   "originalText": "inlab-human has a reader-study protocol (bundle, review,\nreport), a clinician console (haichat-inlab), the endpoint-predict\ntool both use, an agent drawer, and a de-identification boundary\nit does not enforce itself.",
